{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。ずっと上げたかったブログ、遅くなっちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん、卒業おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生の親友"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『らりにゃんコンビ』！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年で、上京組で、青春時代を\nずっと一緒に過ごしてきたらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことがあったけど\n乃木坂で出会えて本当に良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いどんな道に進んでも、\n素敵な大人になろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の心の変化にすぐに気付いていつも相談にのってくれてたらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の誕生日になると、家に押しかけてきて\nピンポン鳴らしまくってたらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでいて、誕プレにスナック菓子とかくれるらりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年大掃除の季節に、私の家の排水溝を掃除しにきてくれるお母さんみたいならりん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の用もない日に勝手に家にあがりこんできては、\n私のベッドでひたすらゴロゴロしたあと\n何事もなかったかのように帰るらりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんならりんが大好き。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱きついてきたりキスしてくるらりんは\nちょっと...（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、らりんといた毎日が本当に楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"離れてもまたご飯とか行くし、私の家にも遊びにきてね！\nあと誘ってた温泉もまだ行けてないから行くぞ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔と元気を有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、らりんの笑顔が\nずーっと続きますよーに！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりにゃんは永遠だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/03/26/0241235/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}